WEBVTT

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.700
--Happy birthday, Ma-i-na!

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.620
--Yeah, yeah, yeah!
--Happy birthday, Ma-i-na!

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.910
--The miraculous birthday celebration
that lights up the world!

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.750
--Woo, woo, woo!
--The miraculous birthday celebration
that lights up the world!

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:24.580
Let's give thanks to Maina's parents, too!

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.370
Let's give thanks to Maina's parents, too!
"*This is just how they look in Eripiyo's mind."

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:28.830
Thank you!

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.660
Yeah!

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:31.950
"Congrats! Happy Birthday, Maina"

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:36.370
What am I doing at a maid café
on such an important day?

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.620
Could you not lose your momentum so suddenly?

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:40.910
And I'm here alone with Kumasa for some reason.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:42.750
Hey, don't take this out on me!

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.910
You're the one who wanted to throw
Maina a personal birthday party

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:49.870
since Cham doesn't have a venue until February.

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:56.040
But now that I actually did it, all I feel is
loneliness, desolation, and pain!

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:59.080
Well, should we have invited Motoi and Rena?

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:02.040
No. Rena's studying for her exams,

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.870
and Motoi's flat broke after his wallet
got stolen during the first shrine visit.

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.830
Uh, this is the first I'm hearing about that...

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:10.450
And wait a sec. I wasn't invited
to the first shrine visit!

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:12.450
No idol <i>wota </i>would feel
the need to invite a betrayer

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:15.250
who spent their New Year's with their fave.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:19.120
I just want to be able to tell Maina...

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:21.370
"Thank you for being born."

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:26.000
"Thank you for appearing before me as an idol."

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.000
U-Um, are you ready to order?

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Huh?

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.450
She's actually here!

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:10.040
Maina just witnessed something so embarrassing!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.410
"Your Fave Isn't Your Friend"
Really? You're worried about that now?

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:16.830
"Your Fave Isn't Your Friend"
She even saw me surrounded by other girls...

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:19.660
Maybe we should've just went to karaoke.

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:22.500
M-Maina? What a coincidence!

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:26.580
Who knew that Eripiyo would show up
the day you started working here part time?

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:28.370
Yup. It's a total coincidence.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.410
Eripiyo's never been here before,

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:35.080
and it's not like she's eyeing other girls
or switching her fave to me...

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:38.830
I coincidentally got to see
Eripiyo on my birthday...

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.700
--Isn't that amazing?!
--What?

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.870
Even if there was a concert,
who knows if it'd actually be on my birthday.

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:46.330
But I got to see her while
we're not even performing!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.200
And she was even nice enough to celebrate it.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:52.450
I'm not sure what I should do...

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:55.580
Then hurry up and go get
their orders again, dummy!

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:59.790
A-Are you ready to order?

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:03.750
I can't! I can't talk to Maina
without paying money first!

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:07.580
Uh, we're at a café, so you'll be paying money.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.410
Look. You can even get a photo op for 500 yen.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.790
But isn't that working off the clock?!

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:14.330
I-I'm not an idol right now...

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:16.620
Her occupation right now is a maid!

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:19.500
I've only ever supported Maina as an idol,

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.870
so this is my first time
meeting Maina as a maid!

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:24.330
The audacity of asking her
for a photo op for 500 yen!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:26.500
I could never do something like that!

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:29.580
But that's just how maid cafés work...

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.790
U-Um, I'm...

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.620
Ugh, you guys are such a pain.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.910
Maina, come here!

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.290
Here. Satisfied?

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.540
I'll put the photo op fee on your tab.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:43.200
Bless ye...

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.200
I'll make this a family heirloom
for generations to come.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.910
I don't think that's what
"a photo with" entails here.

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:51.790
You're a goddess when you're a maid, A-ya.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:53.500
I'm always a goddess.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.370
You just never got in my line.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.040
What?

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:04.450
I'm just a little jealous because you
act like you're friends with Eripiyo...

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:08.910
Well, I mean, she's a regular.
I see her all the time, so it's natural.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:12.910
But I see her all the time, too.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.750
Wait. A regular?

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.750
You said this was her first time here earlier...

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.330
Welcome home, Master!

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:26.870
I couldn't eat or drink anything
knowing Maina was watching me.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:31.370
What a waste. You actually had a chance
to talk to her without a monitor.

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:33.250
Whoa, there! Did you catch a cold?

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:36.750
If Maina gave me this cold...

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:42.080
...I'll never let myself get better and trap
Maina's pathogenic microbes in my body!

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:44.620
But Maina didn't have a cold.

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:47.870
Must be pathogenic microbes from
some random old guy at the café.

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:50.330
Don't go sullying my dreams!

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.160
And don't think I didn't notice
you take a step away from me!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:56.080
Hey! Don't cough on me!

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:58.370
"A few days later--"

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:00.540
S-Say what?!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.950
"ChamJam Special Concert in Shopping Mall Okayama"
"Date and time: 1/25 (Sat) 13:00~"
A concert?! And in only three days?!

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:07.040
Come on, management!
Why's that information so late--

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:11.290
Can't you at least be quiet when you're sick?

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:13.830
Say, do you think I'll be better in three days?

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:14.870
Can I go out then?

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:16.700
Of course you can't.

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:20.620
What if you catch the flu
when your body's still weak?

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:22.870
Well?

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:24.370
I guess...

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:27.700
Well, I'm going to work.
Make sure you stay in bed.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:37.000
This sucks... I'm gonna die...

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.500
Someone take care of me.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.160
Maybe I could call a friend...

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:44.200
Or not. They all have jobs.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.040
Those heartless bastards.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:50.950
Maina...

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.870
Well, your fave isn't your friend...

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.790
But I still feel a little better.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:02.290
Thank you, Maina.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:08.330
Hey, guys! It's been a while!

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:10.040
Yeah!

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.830
Sorry to make you wait for
our first concert of the year!

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:15.500
We've been waiting to see you!

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.540
Also, sorry about one other thing.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.410
Maki and Yuka won't be here today
because they caught a cold.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.160
--What?
--You've got this!

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:25.290
But the rest of us will work even harder,

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:28.870
and I hope you guys keep an eye
on our different formation until the end!

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:30.870
Yeah!

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:33.790
All right! Here's our first song.

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:37.120
It's been a while.

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:37.870
Yeah.

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.000
This is so calming.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.080
Really?

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:41.790
Yumeri's up front?!

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.080
Yume!

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.660
We're counting on you, Yumeri.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:46.830
R-Right...

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.870
Are you better now, Maki?

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:54.660
Yeah, I'm feeling much better.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.580
I see. Thank goodness.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.580
Is something wrong, Yume?

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.750
Huh? I-It's nothing...

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:07.330
It's just I'll have to be
in the front row today.

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:08.580
Are you nervous?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:11.950
Then should I...

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:14.080
...give you my cold, Yume?

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:20.750
I'm just kidding.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:30.620
Don't worry. I know you'll be fine, Yume.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:42.540
♪ Hurry up, sun ♪

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:45.330
♪ Wake up! Wake up! ♪

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:50.040
♪ I won't say that ♪

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:54.540
♪ I hate mornings today ♪

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:56.620
♪ I can't wait 3 minutes or even a second ♪

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:58.450
♪ I can't wait 3 minutes or even a second ♪
A-ya's in the front row?

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:01.160
♪ I can't wait 3 minutes or even a second ♪
Our little sister is up front!

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:10.540
♪ Open the door to the summer that'll tan my chest ♪

00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:13.200
♪ Here we go! A tropical step ♪

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:16.330
♪ Here we go! A tropical step ♪
"My bad. I somehow still caught
a cold even though I'm stupid."

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:20.950
♪ A suddenly hot, summer holiday ♪
Jeez, even I wouldn't say that about you.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:24.200
♪ My bouncy heart is filled with sun
and turns into fluffy wings ♪
"I'll be standing in the front row,
so you just get plenty of rest."

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.700
♪ My bouncy heart is filled with sun
and turns into fluffy wings ♪
"Okay... I feel much better
knowing you'll be in my place."

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:34.410
Next time, I'll be standing in front
because of me!

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.790
Maina's in the front row?!

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:45.000
I hope you're watching, Eripiyo!

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:46.790
Huh?

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:50.950
Eripiyo?!

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.290
I see...

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:04.410
So Eripiyo caught a cold?

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:07.750
Yeah. She said she didn't
want to give it to you.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:11.660
I wouldn't mind getting a cold from Eripiyo.

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:14.000
Could you tell her that I hope
she feels better soon?

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:18.000
Definitely! I wish she could've
seen you up front though.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:22.040
Right? Who knows when I'll get to do that again!

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:26.410
Do your best to get back up front
for Eripiyo's sake, too.

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:27.410
I will!

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:32.080
Hello? How are you feeling, Eripiyo--

00:10:32.080 --> 00:10:33.870
More importantly, how was the show today?

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:35.080
Huh?!

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.870
If I actually tell her Maina
was standing in the front row...

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:42.540
So, you see...

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:47.040
I wasn't able to see Maina the first time
she was in the front row...

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:53.660
M-Maina! I missed your first time up in front!

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:56.620
That'll probably haunt her
for the rest of her life...

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:59.410
M-Maina looked like she was having a lot of fun.

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:02.250
Why were you watching Maina?

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:05.160
Wh-What do you mean?

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:08.660
You're a Reo fan.
Why were you able to admire Maina?

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:11.290
Don't tell me Maina was in the front row...

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:13.620
O-Of course not...

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:16.700
There's no way Maina would
end up in the front row!

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.500
M-Maina...

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:21.410
Don't let it get to you, Maina.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:24.120
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:27.160
Kumasa is probably trying to be nice.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:31.160
He's probably talking to Eripiyo.

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:32.410
Must be nice...

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:37.410
I can't even be her friend...

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:41.660
More importantly!
There was an announcement after the concert.

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:44.160
Reo's going to be in a drama!

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:46.910
That's amazing! But why is it always Reo?!

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.080
No fair!

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:53.450
Huh? Eripiyo?

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:56.250
Hello? Hello?!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.080
"She tore up her throat..."

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.660
No... It can't be...

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:06.660
I can't believe that my mom
is actually my father!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.450
That can't be true!

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:11.580
I'm sorry... I'm so sorry!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:14.450
Wait, Mo--

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:16.580
Dad!

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:18.950
"Oh..."

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:22.040
"You said drama, but she was just a guest star
on a local channel drama..."

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:25.580
Hey! I know she's not your fave, but...

00:12:25.580 --> 00:12:28.750
I mean, it aired in Okayama and Kagawa.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:31.000
Wasn't Reo's acting great?

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:34.620
She was in a youth acting troupe
when she was little.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:35.870
"Really?"
Oh, really?

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:40.450
"Really?"
Yup! But after watching this drama, I realized...

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:43.080
Reo's really good at crying as an actress,

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:48.410
so I might not be able to realize
when she's actually sad.

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.120
When she's really sad...

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.870
"Motoi was crying for real when
someone stole his wallet. Weren't you?"

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.580
"Motoi was crying for real when
someone stole his wallet. Weren't you?"
Leave me alone, jeez!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.120
Also, why do you keep writing on that?

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:59.040
It's sort of hard to talk to you.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:02.580
"This cold murdered my throat--"
--What?
--Now, now, you two.

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:05.200
Remember, today's an important day.

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:08.410
Yes. Today is...

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:13.160
...the insanely important Valentine's Day event!

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:16.450
Photo op and chocolate! Photo op and chocolate!

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:20.370
Photo op and chocolate!
Photo op and chocolate time!

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:21.580
Yay!

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:22.910
"Woo"

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:26.870
Maybe I went a bit overboard...

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:30.200
I wouldn't say so. Valentine's only comes
around once a year, after all.

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.950
Not to mention, Sorane...

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:35.660
"Born on 2/13"
Exactly! I at least got to write
something in her birthday card!

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:39.580
Hopefully someday, I'll be a part of the
committee to plan her birthday celebration.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:40.660
"You've got this!"

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:42.910
Oh, there they are.

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:44.450
Sorry, I'm late.

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:45.910
"It's been a while, Rena!"

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:47.700
Did I miss the memo about whiteboards?

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:52.330
Happy Valentine's Day!

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.450
There's definitely something in the air...

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:57.120
Can you blame them?

00:13:57.120 --> 00:14:01.950
Usually, we idol <i>wota</i>s are satisfied
with the dreams that our faves show us.

00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:07.540
But today is the only day we're allowed to
receive a dream that has a physical shape!

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:09.950
I've never experienced anything like this.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.370
How am I supposed to receive the chocolate?

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.200
Never mind. I can't read all that.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.620
Are these the chocolates
we're going to be handing out?

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:21.120
They're so cute!

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.410
Hey, can I have some if there are any left over?

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:24.200
Sure...

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:26.500
Really?! I was totally kidding.

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:28.410
There's definitely going to be some left over.

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:31.000
Huh?

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.000
Someone ordered too many...

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:37.330
Holy crap! It's like a chocolate harem!

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:43.500
Today's the one day that I can repay Eripiyo.

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:48.620
M-Maybe I can include my contact info in this...

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.700
...and we can become friends.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:53.330
I'm sure you know this,

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:56.160
but we're not allowed to give them
anything other than the chocolates.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.870
--We know!
--We know, duh!

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:04.830
Thank you for appearing before me as an idol.

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:06.620
That's right.

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:11.500
Eripiyo is supporting me as an idol.

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:14.160
Maina, how many do you want?

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:16.750
U-Um, two?

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:18.790
That's way too little!

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:19.580
Here you go.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.160
This many?

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:23.450
But I don't have that many fans...

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:27.580
Isn't this fun? This is the one time
I get to give out chocolate.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:32.250
Really? You seem like you'd have
a lot of guy friends, Sorane.

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:36.370
I just seem like I do. I'm an idol, after all.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.540
Thank you all for today!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.450
So we'll be handing out
the chocolates after this.

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:50.290
The girls and I talked about this, but we
thought we'd make it a 3-shot photo op.

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:53.790
So we can get chocolates from two girls?

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:56.580
I'm sure you guys wouldn't mind
more chocolates, right?

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.660
I mean, you know...

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:01.790
We might end up with too much chocolate.

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:03.830
We have to do something about them!

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:05.080
Please...

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.410
...help us out!

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:08.580
I mean, if you don't want any, that's fine.

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.500
I'll just take all the extras.

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.410
A 3-shot photo op!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:17.410
Wow! That's such a great deal!

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.410
No, this is rather dangerous.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:21.910
Because your fave will find out
who your second fave is!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:25.500
Huh?! Wh-What should we do, Kumasa?!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.080
I'd like to choose Reo and Sorane.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:27.910
Huh?!

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:30.120
Have you always had your eyes on Sorane?!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:33.790
You can't! I don't think I can deal
with us both having the same fave!

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.580
She's my friend's fave,
so there's nothing to worry about!

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:40.580
Oh, I get it! In that case,
I'll get Sorane and Reo--

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:41.910
Stare...

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.290
Stare...

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:47.290
Or Maina...

00:16:47.290 --> 00:16:49.830
By the way, Eripiyo...

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:54.410
I just happened to see a report about it,
but apparently, at the last concert, Maina was--

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:59.700
"Gimme one"
I just happened to have a scallop adductor!
Do you like those, Rena?!

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:03.500
Eripiyo, I just happened to see
on Twitter that Maina--

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:08.200
Motoi, here's an adductor muscle
keychain, just for you!

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:09.620
I don't want it...

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.660
--But look! It's an adductor muscle!
--Next person, please.

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:13.450
"Maina and Maina, please"

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.500
"Maina to my right, Maina to my left"

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:20.500
Um... It doesn't matter who,
just pick someone else, please...

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:24.000
"Do you really think I can choose
someone other than Maina...?"

00:17:24.160 --> 00:17:26.910
We have some extras, so I'll just
go ahead and pick Aya for you...

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:27.910
"D'oh!!"

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:30.200
Thank you for always supporting us!

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:35.750
--This is kind of embarrassing.
--Reo's smiling at everyone!

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:37.910
That's my Reo.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:41.410
The fact that she treats
everyone equally is her best quality!

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.040
"2-shot photo op" "Reo"
All right.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:46.080
We have one for Reo and Sorane!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:49.040
Happy Valentine's Day, Kumasa!

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:51.040
Thanks, you two.

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:53.410
You were great in that drama, Reo.

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:56.660
Really? I'm so embarrassed.

00:17:56.660 --> 00:18:00.330
Ever since I heard you were
in a youth acting troupe,

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:04.000
it was my dream to see you in a drama one day.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:08.790
You make all of my dreams
about you come true, Reo.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:11.370
You appeared in the festival
I wanted you to appear in.

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:13.330
You even became the center.

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:17.580
And you became number 1
in the popularity ranking.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:20.870
And you were involved in all of those, Kumasa.

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:25.040
What's your next dream, Kumasa?

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:28.750
For you to go to the Budokan, Reo.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.620
Let's go together.

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:41.660
Wow! That was amazing!

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:45.080
I've never seen Reo look like that before!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:50.450
The next person picked Maina and Sorane!

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.950
I've never taken a shot with two of you girls...

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:55.790
Where should I stand?

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:57.500
People pick the middle usually.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:58.500
Yeah.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.870
Oh, thanks.

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:05.500
I've only ever supported you, Sorane,
so this is all new to me.

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:08.540
There's so much I don't know.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:09.870
That's fine.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:15.660
Cham's just going to get bigger,
and I'll be doing a lot of firsts, too.

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:20.620
Even if I'm doing something for the first time,
I feel more confident if you're with me, Motoi!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:23.830
Yeah! I'm going to keep supporting you forever!

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:25.660
You're the only one for me, Sorane!

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.830
Aw, thanks.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:29.700
You're amazing, Sorane.

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:35.120
I've never been able to have such
an idol-like conversation with Eripiyo.

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:38.580
I... I also...

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:39.580
Yay!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:49.950
No one's taking photos with Maina!
She's not even people's second fave?!

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:51.910
Do you people even have eyes?!

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:53.750
We actually want to use this opportunity...

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.830
...to go to Maina...

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:59.750
I don't want Eripiyo to find out
Maina's my second fave...

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:01.370
Eripiyo...

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:04.370
I've never done a photo op before...

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:06.790
Rena sure is nervous.

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:08.540
Okay, have no fear!

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.120
H-Huh?

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:12.790
My whiteboard!

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:14.830
Where did I leave it?! The bathroom?!

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:16.830
Eripiyo?

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:18.910
"2-shot photo op" "Maina"
All right, thank you.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:21.080
Maina, Sorane!

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:22.080
Coming!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:26.250
Eripiyo, I'm a bit nervous,
so could you watch from there?

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:27.410
What?!

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.830
But I have to go look for my board!

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.330
That was so great!

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:36.330
I'm rooting for you, too, Eripiyo!

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.120
"2-shot photo op" "Maina"
All right, thank you.

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:43.410
It's Eripiyo's turn.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:44.950
Maina and Aya!

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:46.870
Wait, why me?! How scary!

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:49.330
The other one is... Aya?!

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:55.750
What should I do? Without my board...

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:58.120
Um, Eripiyo...

00:20:58.120 --> 00:20:59.660
Why me, though?!

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:01.700
You're asking me?

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:04.290
I'd like to know that myself, to be honest.

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:07.000
But I can't say that because
I don't have my board.

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:15.790
The heck is this?

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.250
Is it because Aya's her friend?

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.870
No... That doesn't matter!

00:21:20.870 --> 00:21:24.790
Because I'm the idol that Eripiyo supports,

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.500
I'm going to have her see me properly!

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:29.910
H-Happy Valentine's Day, Eripiyo!

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:33.620
You're my first fan ever!

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:38.370
Everything you've done for me
has been a first for me!

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:42.040
So I want to experience so much more with you!

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:43.410
Maina...

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:45.160
I know you didn't get to see me

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:47.660
in the front row for the first
time ever last month,

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:49.750
but I plan to share even
more important firsts with--

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:51.910
Hold up!

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:54.830
I didn't know about that!

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:59.120
Huh? Eripiyo?

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:01.040
Eripiyo!

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:05.120
"She tore up her throat yet again"

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:06.660
"And then..."

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:11.830
It's finally better.

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:14.330
Now I'll be fine no matter
what happens to Maina!

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:19.870
"The groups that will be performing at Setouchi
Idol Fes have been decided!"

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:22.370
Huh... I guess Cham's appearing, too...

00:22:22.370 --> 00:22:23.040
Huh?

00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:26.160
Hold up! Why did I find this out here
before Cham's official sources?!

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:28.750
Do your damn job, managem--

00:22:31.620 --> 00:22:35.040
"And she tore up her throat again"

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:08.410
This year's Valentine event
was a 3-shot photo op!

00:24:08.410 --> 00:24:10.870
Huh? I-I don't have a second fave!

00:24:10.870 --> 00:24:12.830
Maki for life!

00:24:12.830 --> 00:24:15.450
B-By the way, Maki,
I heard you're going to be on TV!

00:24:15.450 --> 00:24:17.250
I'll watch it, no matter what! I'll record it!

00:24:17.250 --> 00:24:18.660
And I'll watch it a million times
after I record it!

00:24:18.660 --> 00:24:19.830
"The Closest Miracle to Me"
Thank you very much!
